BT 1 0 0 1 0 83.8 Tm /F5 8 Tf 10.2 TL (mergeSort\(list, compareBy\):          // compareBy = expiry date or price) Tj T* (    if list.size <= 1: return list) Tj T* (    left  = mergeSort\(firstHalf\(list\),  compareBy\)) Tj T* (    right = mergeSort\(secondHalf\(list\), compareBy\)) Tj T* (    return merge\(left, right, compareBy\)   // take the smaller front item each time) Tj T*  T* (lowStockReport\(\):) Tj T* (    for each m in medicineMap.values\(\): if m.stock < LOW_STOCK \(10\): add m to result) Tj T* (    if result is empty: return "No medicines below the low-stock threshold.") Tj T* ET
